Success comes from consistent effort. Study a little every day!
</p>
</div></section><!-- SUBJECTS --><section id="subjects" class="section"><h1>📚 WASSCE Subjects</h1>
<p style="margin:10px 0;">Choose a subject to read quick study notes and practice.</p><input class="search" type="text" placeholder="🔎 Search subjects..." onkeyup="searchSubjects(this.value)"><div class="grid" id="subjectGrid"><div class="subject-card" data-name="core mathematics maths math">
