<p style="margin:10px 0;">Test your knowledge with questions from different subjects.</p><div class="card"><p id="quizSubject" style="color:var(--primary);font-weight:bold;"></p>
<h2 id="questionText">Loading question...</h2><div id="options"></div><p id="quizFeedback" style="margin-top:15px;font-weight:bold;"></p><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
<button class="btn" onclick="nextQuestion()">Next Question</button>
